flowchart TD
    User([Passenger / User])
    SearchInput[City & Date Input]
    SeedGen[Seed Generation: hashSeed(from-to-date)]
    BusGen[Procedural Bus & Seat Generator]
    BusList[Filtered & Sorted Bus Results]
    SeatSelect[Seat Selection Buffer (Max 6 Seats)]
    PassengerInput[Passenger Details & Boarding Point]
    CouponEngine[Coupon Validation Engine]
    FareCalc[Fare Calculation: Base + Fees + Taxes - Discount]
    PayGateway[Payment Gateway Simulation (UPI/Card/NetBank)]
    StorageCommit[mockDb.addBooking -> localStorage]
    TicketGen[Ticket / Digital Boarding Pass Display]

    User -->|Enters criteria| SearchInput
    SearchInput --> SeedGen
    SeedGen --> BusGen
    BusGen --> BusList
    BusList -->|User selects bus & seats| SeatSelect
    SeatSelect --> PassengerInput
    PassengerInput --> CouponEngine
    CouponEngine --> FareCalc
    FareCalc --> PayGateway
    PayGateway -->|Payment Approved| StorageCommit
    StorageCommit --> TicketGen
    TicketGen -->|View / Print Boarding Pass| User
